# The claims pack cites measured results, and a citation that only resolves on
# the machine that produced it is not evidence. The small summary receipts are
# copied here deliberately so a clone can verify every published number; the
# multi-megabyte failure dumps they derive from stay ignored above.
!docs/evidence/artifacts/
/reports/
benchmark/reports/generated/
benchmark/cache/
benchmark/public-runs/
